
========================================================================
  THE WIGGLY GRAPH Q(n) AT n=5
========================================================================

  WIGGLY GRAPH Q(5):
  Vertices: 2^6 = 64 tilings
  Degree: 6 (= C(4,2) = triangular number T_3)
  Tiles: [('A', (4, 0)), ('B', (3, 0)), ('C', (2, 0)), ('D', (4, 1)), ('E', (3, 1)), ('F', (4, 2))]

  Iso classes: 12 (unmerged), 10 (merged)
  Tilings per class:
    mid=0: H= 1, fiber=1 (1 unmerged)
    mid=4: H= 3, fiber=2 (2 unmerged)
    mid=8: H= 3, fiber=1 (1 unmerged)
    mid=2: H= 5, fiber=10 (2 unmerged)
    mid=1: H= 9, fiber=9 (1 unmerged)
    mid=5: H= 9, fiber=9 (1 unmerged)
    mid=3: H=11, fiber=11 (1 unmerged)
    mid=6: H=13, fiber=13 (1 unmerged)
    mid=7: H=15, fiber=3 (1 unmerged)
    mid=9: H=15, fiber=5 (1 unmerged)

